*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
